 st time on Ash Wednesday\, February 22\,  at 7:30 AM\, at the PoindexterGri
 ll which is in the Graduate Hotel just across Kirkwood from theChurch.  Ent
 er the front door and turn to the right for the Cafe. Persons will buy what
  they want\, prices ranging from $3 - $9 for breakfastitems.  Conceived by 
 David Garshaw\, Chuck Jones\, and Tim Jessen\, we willprobably meet for one
  hour\, and continue during Lent and beyond\, as desired bythe group.  Disc
 ussion topics to be decided by group\, with Ash Wednesdaytheme the first ti
 me.  Come one\, come all--and let&#39\;s expand our connectionsright here w
 here we are.  </span></p>
